
#### 2. `agentcare/.gitignore`
```gitignore
# Byte-compiled
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Environments
.env
.venv/
venv/

# Database
*.db
*.sqlite3

# ChromaDB
chroma_db/

# Uploads
uploads/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# Distribution
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# Testing
.pytest_cache/
htmlcov/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db